  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto held a two-hour private discussion with senior legislator Dasco at Merdeka Palace on November 24, 2026. Reports indicate the conversation centered on the mechanism for relaying public aspirations to the House of Representatives (DPR). This meeting follows recent interactions involving high-level government figures and legislators regarding legislative updates. Earlier in November, Defense Minister Sjafrie Sjamsoeddin and Coordinating Minister Yusril Ihza Mahendra met with Dasco to discuss the planned revision of the State Defense Law. Amid these formal engagements, Dasco also addressed public speculation regarding his political trajectory, affirming his commitment to his role within the DPR and clarifying that he has not sought candidacy for other positions. The coordination between the executive branch and legislative leadership remains a point of observation for domestic media outlets tracking these government proceedings.",
